Upgrade Jinja2 from 2.10 to 3.1.6

Jinja2 2.10 lets a sandboxed template reach str.format and escape the
sandbox (CVE-2019-10906, GHSA-462w-v97r-4m45, fixed in 2.10.1). The report
templates are rendered from client-selected names, so a sandbox escape would
run template code with the service's privileges. The pin moves straight to
3.1.6, the current release with no open advisory; MarkupSafe stays at 3.0.2.
